  "scope": "file_delivery_read_workbook_search accepts the existing full VerifiedFile and returns WorkbookCapture/WorkbookReadFailure. Shared search_source extracted from DOCX: complete source <=1MiB, safe expected opening and pre-body version/location checks, max+1 growth sentinel, final full SHA/revision equality. Both old 16MiB previews and ZIP/CRC/inflate/readpool mechanisms unchanged.",
  "redBoundary": "Compiled initial new search entry deliberately delegated the old workbook reader. The exact1MiB control passed;1MiB+1 search rejection failed with actual101. This is the new entry admission test red, not a claim that the old16MiB preview contract was broken. Original raw sources and command logs retained.",
  "verificationBoundary": "40 scoped Rust tests and cargo fmt passed. Actual checked_workbook_search uses production pool in controlled temporary fixtures; no real Webview/Main origin integration, frontend workbook search semantics, full seven checks, installed App/Agent or user data acceptance inferred. No cancellation/timeout promise beyond unchanged shared pool tests.",
  "rustCompileReleased": true
